ad some success in the first place?", "sp": "Chris", "hl": [86, 104], "o": "audio/ch_t02/o09.mp3", "q": "audio/ch_t02/q09.mp3", "src": [143.35, 144.33], "t": 138.42, "m": [["o", 138.42], ["o", 140.08], ["o", 141.75], ["z", 143.42], ["o", 145.42], ["o", 147.09], ["o", 148.75]]}, {"n": 11, "c": "At least for me", "zh": "至少对我来说", "s": "At least for me, I always wanted to take the path of material success first.", "sp": "Naval", "hl": [0, 15], "o": "audio/ch_t02/o10.mp3", "q": "audio/ch_t02/q10.mp3", "src": [146.88, 148.1], "t": 150.73, "m": [["o", 150.73], ["o", 152.63], ["o", 154.54], ["z", 156.44], ["o", 158.61], ["o", 160.51], ["o", 162.42]]}, {"n": 12, "c": "it's all kind of meaningless", "zh": "这一切都有点没意义", "s": "In the story of Buddha, he starts out as a prince and then he sees that it’s all kind of meaningless because you’re still gonna get old and die,", "sp": "Naval", "hl": [72, 100], "o": "audio/ch_t02/o11.mp3", "q": "audio/ch_t02/q11.mp3", "src": [163.62, 164.51], "t": 164.64, "m": [["o", 164.64], ["o", 166.24], ["o", 167.83], ["z", 169.42], ["o", 171.97], ["o", 173.57], ["o", 175.17]]}, {"n": 13, "c": "looking for something more", "zh": "寻找更多的东西", "s": "and then he goes into the woods looking for something more.", "sp": "Naval", "hl": [32, 58], "o": "audio/ch_t02/o12.mp3", "q": "audio/ch_t02/q12.mp3", "src": [167.62, 168.86], "t": 176.94, "m": [["o", 176.94], ["o", 178.87], ["o", 180.8], ["z", 182.73], ["o", 185.14], ["o", 187.06], ["o", 188.99]]}, {"n": 14, "c": "I'll take the happy route", "zh": "我会选快乐的那条路", "s": "I’ll take the happy route that involves material success. Thank you.", "sp": "Naval", "hl": [0, 25], "o": "audio/ch_t02/o13.mp3", "q": "audio/ch_t02/q13.mp3", "src": [169.92, 172.31], "t": 191.21, "m": [["o", 191.21], ["o", 194.28], ["o", 197.35], ["z", 200.43], ["o", 203.12], ["o", 206.19], ["o", 209.26]]}]}